<%-include("ftc_nav.ejs")%>

<div class="position-relative" style="height: 300px">
    <%-include("../components/image_banner", {image: "ftc/2026/55282148352_b60645fe4f_k.jpg", title: "FIRST Tech Challenge", subtitle: "Ages 12 to 18"})%>
</div>

<div class="container my-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <p>FIRST Tech Challenge brings science, technology, engineering, and math (STEM) alive through a dynamic, 
                hands-on approach to robotics. The program challenges students to apply STEM concepts in real-world 
                situations and inspires tomorrow's innovators and entrepreneurs</p>
            <p>Teams design, build, and program their robots to compete on a 12' X 12' field, in 2v2 matches, against 
                other teams. Robots are built from a reusable platform, powered by Android technology, and programmed 
                using blocks or the Java programming language. Teams, including students, coaches, and mentors, are 
                required to develop strategy and build robots based on sound engineering principles, such as rapid 
                prototyping. Awards are earned for the competition, as well as team's community outreach, robot design, 
                and other real-world accomplishments.</p>
            <a class="btn bg-ftc-orange fw-bold" target="_blank" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScUXuZ8jh7aGsGCltLhjOpcOyzBcZoKLDS3cwsuy0WxgxhNzQ/viewform?usp=header">Start a Team</a>
            <a class="btn bg-ftc-black text-white fw-bold" href="https://ftc-resources.firstinspires.org/ftc/game">Season Materials <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-up-right"></i></a>
            <button class="btn bg-ftc-black text-white" target="_blank" disabled>Competition Manual (Coming Soon)</button>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="yt-container">
                <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Av0PgzmQXs0?si=MhJh832eYX5mnR5a" title="What is FIRST Tech Challenge?" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

