                image: "ftc/2026/7.png",
                text: "Design, build, and program a robot to compete in fast pased 2v2 matches. The Robot game consists of a autonomous and teleoperated period.",
                html: `
                    <button class='btn bg-ftc-black text-white fw-bold my-1' disabled>Competition Manual (Coming Soon)</button>
                    <button class='btn bg-ftc-black text-white fw-bold my-1' disabled>Robot Game Overview Video (Coming Soon)</button>
                `
            })%>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4 d-flex flex-column justify-content-end" style="margin-top: 160px;">
            <%-include("components/comp_requirement_card", 
